.\" vps-optimizer manpage (v8.5)
.\" Install: cp assets/man/vps-optimizer.8 /usr/share/man/man8/ && mandb
.TH VPS-OPTIMIZER 8 "2026-04-26" "8.5" "VPS Optimizer"

.SH NAME
vps-optimizer \- VPS sysctl/sysfs/iptables tuning, stealth noise generator, diagnostics

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vps_optimizer.sh
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.RI [ OPTIONS ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vps-optimizer
applies safe, idempotent network/CPU/RAM optimizations tuned for proxy / VPN / streaming workloads,
generates iOS-Safari-shaped white-noise traffic for traffic analysis resistance, and provides
actionable diagnostics. All settings are probed before write and rolled back automatically if
they break connectivity.

.SH COMMANDS

.SS Application
.TP
.BR apply " [" --preset
.IR NAME "] [" --vpn "] [" --boot "] [" --no-rollback ]
Apply optimizations. Presets:
.BR balanced " (default)," " proxy" ", or " web .
With
.B --vpn
adds rp_filter=2/accept_local/ip_forward (auto-detected from
.IR tun*/wg*/ppp* "/" ipsec* " ifaces).
.B --boot
installs a one-shot systemd unit so apply runs on every reboot (useful on OpenVZ).

.TP
.B reset [\-\-soft]
Roll back. Soft mode keeps DNS / noise / swap untouched.

.TP
.B uninstall
Full removal: reset + remove the script and all artifacts.

.SS Diagnostics
.TP
.B doctor
Actionable diagnostics — conntrack util, retransmits, softnet drops, DNS, snapshots,
PCIe gen, kTLS, systemd-resolved coexistence, eBPF programs, WG kernel-mode.

.TP
.B audit \fR[\fB--json\fR]
Drift / RPS / conntrack / dnscrypt-proxy deep audit.

.TP
.B status \fR[\fB--json\fR]
Live dashboard.

.TP
.B why \fIKEY\fR
Explain why a sysctl was set to its current value.

.TP
.B top
TUI: live conntrack util, TCP states, top-10 connections by retransmits.

.TP
.B mtr \fIHOST\fR
Wrapper around \fBmtr\fR(8).

.TP
.B compare \fR[\fITARGET\fR]
Save / show a ping baseline; default target 1.1.1.1.

.TP
.B stealth-test
Self-check JA3 fingerprint via ja3er.com; warns if your TLS stack is detectable as
\fBcurl\fR rather than iOS Safari (use \fBcurl-impersonate-safari\fR to fix).

.SS Stealth (noise generator)
.TP
.B noise on \fR| \fBoff \fR| \fBedit \fR| \fBstatus \fR| \fBtest \fR| \fBhealth
Manage the white-noise daemon. Default profile mimics iOS Safari + APNs/FCM/WNS push
keepalive + WebRTC STUN bursts + WebSocket-style long-poll.

.SS DNS
.TP
.B dns \fR| \fBdns local\fR | \fBdns plain\fR|\fBdot\fR|\fBdoh \fIPRESET\fR
Configure resolver. Presets:
.BR cloudflare ", " google ", " yandex ", " quad9 ", " adguard "."
With
.B custom
you may pass IPs (plain/dot) or full URLs (doh).

.TP
.B dns doq \fR[\fIPRESET\fR]
DNS-over-QUIC \fB(opt-in)\fR — installation pointer for AdGuard Home (kernel 5.20+ required).

.TP
.B dns dnssec \fBon\fR|\fBoff\fR
DNSSEC validation in unbound \fB(opt-in)\fR.

.SS Telemetry
.TP
.B prom-metrics
Dump Prometheus-format metrics on stdout.

.TP
.B prom-serve \fR[\fIPORT\fR]
Run Prometheus exporter (default :9777).

.TP
.B prom-push \fIGW-URL\fR \fR[\fIJOB\fR]
Push metrics to a Prometheus Pushgateway.

.TP
.B audit-syslog \fIHOST:PORT\fR
Forward the audit-log to a remote syslog (UDP 514).

.SS Backup / playbooks / health
.TP
.B backup-config \fIRCLONE-REMOTE\fR
Snapshot /etc/sysctl.d, /etc/vps-noise.conf, /var/backups/vps-optimizer/ to an rclone target.

.TP
.B playbook \fR{\fBhysteria2-host\fR | \fBwg-vpn-server\fR | \fBweb-frontend\fR}
Apply a role-specific recipe.

.TP
.B health-watch \fR{\fBon\fR | \fBoff\fR | \fBstatus\fR}
Enable a systemd timer that runs \fBdoctor\fR every 5 minutes.

.SS Hardening
.TP
.B harden \fR{\fBssh\fR | \fBufw\fR | \fBupgrades\fR | \fBall\fR}
Opt-in security hardening (does not change \fBapply\fR defaults).

.SH GLOBAL FLAGS
.TP
.B --dry-run
Show what would change without writing.

.TP
.BR --quiet ", " -q
Minimal output (cron-friendly).

.TP
.B --debug
Verbose log to /var/log/vps-optimizer-debug.log.

.TP
.B --force
Bypass lock / confirmations.

.TP
.B --json
Machine-readable JSON output (for status / audit).

.SH EXIT CODES
.TP
.B 0
ok
.TP
.B 10
already-applied (idempotent)
.TP
.B 20
internet-down (apply aborted)
.TP
.B 30
hypervisor-blocked (everything refused)
.TP
.B 40
lock-busy (another apply running)
.TP
.B 50
invalid args / unknown preset
.TP
.B 60
rolled-back (apply succeeded but connectivity degraded → auto-rollback)

.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sysctl.d/99-vps-optimizer.conf
Persistent sysctl settings.
.TP
.I /etc/vps-noise.conf
Noise generator configuration.
.TP
.I /var/backups/vps-optimizer/
Daily and pre-apply snapshots (max 7 daily + 30 pre-apply).
.TP
.I /var/log/vps-optimizer-audit.log
Audit-log of all command invocations.
.TP
.I /var/log/vps-optimizer-debug.log
Debug log (when --debug is used).

.SH SECURITY
.B vps-optimizer
never auto-installs firewall rules that could close SSH, never touches the SSH server
configuration without explicit \fBharden ssh\fR, and rolls back on connectivity loss.

